@ 29.1.1.1.5 - Proto-Athabaskan to Chipewyan
# citation: Whimemsz, from Krauss, Michael and Victor Golla (1981), “Northern Athapaskan
# 			Languages”. Handbook of North American Indians, Vol. 6 (Subarctic), 67 – 85
	TS {TŠ,TŠʷ} [+ cons, - fr, + bk, + hi, - lo] Q > TH TS TŠ [+ cons, - fr, + bk, + hi, - lo]
	t > k (not for all speakers)
	{A,O’} > F / _$
	ɑ ʊ > a o
	Vˀ > V:[+high tone]